**LEGISLATIVE SUBMISSION / DRAFT BILL PROPOSAL**

**Title:** Proposal for Statutory Protection of Discretionary Decisions Made Within the Mandate of the [Insert Office/Division Name]

**Submitted by:** [Your Title/Office], [Ministry/Department Name]
**Date:** [Insert Date]
**To:** [Legislative Committee / Speaker / Relevant Committee Chair]
**Reference:** [Optional: related statute, oversight framework, or prior committee report]

